<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 594.24, down 0.93.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 308 to 222.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,528,750 compared with 19,999,410 on Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
